# Source datasets are versioned so everyone is provably on the same data -
# the repo is private and limited to the four of us plus Stiti.
#
# public/data/build/ is versioned too, even though `npm run data` generates it.
# The Vercel build runs vite only, not the Python step, so the deployed site
# serves these files straight out of public/. Re-run `npm run data` and commit
# the result whenever the source data changes.
